{"unit_id":"Lostforest7__dsh-encoding#card-zh","repo":"Lostforest7/dsh-encoding","commit":"dcce12a068a1065ee08eaaf68f4c0a30a38a569b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-encoding 是面向 DSH 的命令输出编码与乱码恢复插件，注册 encoding_run 和 encoding_decode 两个工具。前者启动子进程并读取原始输出字节，自动识别 UTF-8、UTF-16LE 或 GBK，也可指定编码；后者尝试把已经误读的文本还原。适合需要处理 Windows 中文命令行输出或修复 GBK 乱码的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:82-165","src/exec.js:136-175","src/encoding.js:137-186"]}
